{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/12b91e946cc40fd8ebeea08f357e864a.poster.avif?t=1768329227\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/12b91e946cc40fd8ebeea08f357e864a.webm?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/12b91e946cc40fd8ebeea08f357e864a.mp4?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Out of Gas, Adventure Begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fuel tank is empty and you need to reach your destination! In this 2-4 player cooperative adventure, work together with your team to push, pull, and control your broken-down vehicle through challenging obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/2feada696c57bb2d6f297bde6342766c.poster.avif?t=1768329227\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/2feada696c57bb2d6f297bde6342766c.webm?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/2feada696c57bb2d6f297bde6342766c.mp4?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-Based Realistic Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics engine makes every movement of your vehicle matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong move can reset all your progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise control and team coordination required</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/f8ecdcae5004d3c9cafbb28ed5b0fd94.poster.avif?t=1768329227\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/f8ecdcae5004d3c9cafbb28ed5b0fd94.webm?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/f8ecdcae5004d3c9cafbb28ed5b0fd94.mp4?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Obstacles and Puzzles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steep hills, narrow passages, and dangerous bridges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level demands new strategies and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect timing and teamwork are essential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/5b63adf0bcf14e91065693f00ce21ad7.poster.avif?t=1768329227\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/5b63adf0bcf14e91065693f00ce21ad7.webm?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/5b63adf0bcf14e91065693f00ce21ad7.mp4?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop strategies together with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone's role is critical - success is impossible alone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/375d1d017628acf7c22374f74d5690b8.poster.avif?t=1768329227\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/375d1d017628acf7c22374f74d5690b8.webm?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/375d1d017628acf7c22374f74d5690b8.mp4?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you and your team endure to the end in this nerve-testing, patience-demanding, yet incredibly satisfying experience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/149ad5b6b8e8beab32d8658fe7dc701b.poster.avif?t=1768329227\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/149ad5b6b8e8beab32d8658fe7dc701b.webm?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/149ad5b6b8e8beab32d8658fe7dc701b.mp4?t=1768329227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877380?t=1768329227","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/582cb8078710e0f4e8caa96b4deec9d8538be942/page